  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **I've Got The Sex**: back after 61 archived shows (1333 days) [3]\n- **Recognition Scene**: back after 31 archived shows (531 days) [3]\n- **The Garden Song**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Alphabetizing**: back after 52 archived shows (1025 days); rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Going to Kansas**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n- **Going to Queens**: back after 48 archived shows (1004 days); rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Neon Orange Glimmer Song**: back after 24 archived shows (416 days) [3]\n- **Alpha Sun Hat**: back after 85 archived shows (3221 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2006-12-02** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 62 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2006-12-02**: taped by Chris Bellew; transferred by Chris Bellew; source: SP-CMC-2>SP-SPSB-1>iRiver ihp-140 [1]. Also: The uploader took the videos out of the collection so the show would appear in searches, and put them in Open Source Movies [1]",
